## Project Setup Instructions

1. Clone the repository

```
git clone https://github.com/your-github-username/akan-name-generator.git
```

2. Open the project folder.

3. Open the project in Visual Studio Code.

4. Launch `index.html` using Live Server or open it directly in your browser.

---

## BDD (Behavior Driven Development)

| Behavior | Input | Output |
|----------|-------|--------|
| User enters a valid birth date and selects Male | 12/08/2005, Male | Displays day of birth and male Akan name |
| User enters a valid birth date and selects Female | 12/08/2005, Female | Displays day of birth and female Akan name |
| User enters an invalid day | 40 | Alert: "Day must be between 1 and 31." |
| User enters an invalid month | 15 | Alert: "Month must be between 1 and 12." |
| User leaves fields empty | Empty form | Alert requesting complete birth date |
| User does not select gender | No gender selected | Alert requesting gender selection |

